Author: 3DS Local Wireless Relay

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 2
    Revision: 0

Targets: # Low title IDs this plugin targets (0 for all). Install per title under /luma/plugins/<titleid>/.
    #- 0x00055D00 # Pokémon X
    #- 0x00055E00 # Pokémon Y

Title: UDS Relay shim (passthrough)

Summary: Logs every local-wireless call the game makes

Description: |
  Phase 2 passthrough shim. Intercepts the game's nwm::UDS and ndm:u
  service sessions, forwards every call to the real services unchanged,
  and logs each request, reply and payload to sdmc:/udsrelay/logs.

Compatibility: Console

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
